WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:04,020
If I really hit a wild animal, would the team know about it? Captain Wang, could he not ask questions?

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:07,637
Qin Tian

3
00:00:07,637 --> 00:00:16,680
Come here

4
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:19,870
You delivered food to Mr. Shen's family early this morning.

5
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:23,870
Cornmeal, potatoes, sweet potatoes, and fish and meat

6
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:26,960
Where did you get so many things?

7
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:30,340
Sure enough, someone was jealous of Tianyang

8
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:34,420
Captain Wang, to tell you the truth

9
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:38,000
I found a medicinal spring in the mountains before

10
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Later, I met Mr. Fang, a traveling doctor.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
He said that the spring water was rare, and he was willing to exchange it with me for food.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,160
Drinking it is really effective for Bride Shen’s illness.

13
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,160
I just gave some away

14
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:48,290
So I caught it in Shanxi

15
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:50,290
Meat is bought by saving money

16
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:51,510
where is the whole eye

17
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:54,630
Black shrimp leads deep into Shanao

18
00:00:54,630 --> 00:00:57,700
Hard to find, close to traces of wild boar activity

19
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:59,790
Go for the second time
